Template: michka-hub/run-user
Type: string
Default: michka
Description: System user to run the Michka hub as:
 The Michka hub runs unprivileged (never as root). The installer creates a locked,
 no-login system user with this name to own the hub's data and run the service, and
 adds it to a "michka" group used to authorise the hub's kiosk/display actions.
 .
 Accept the default "michka", enter a different name to use instead, name an EXISTING
 user to reuse it (it is added to the "michka" group but otherwise left unchanged and
 never removed on uninstall), or enter "root" to run the hub as root (not recommended).
